  "prefLabel": "Ahp 204.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ahp 204.01 Principles of Dispute Resolution. The boards shall resolve by agreement or by a decision all disputes about non-criminal matters within its statutory jurisdiction and the administrative rules adopted to implement its statutes.\n\nSource. #7232, eff 4-15-00; ss by #8078, eff 5-1-04",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ahp100-600.html"
